WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.951
This video shows how to schedule a follow-up for an enquiry on a phone.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:16.961
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Admissions and choose Enquiries. Each enquiry is a card, and we will schedule a call back for Hamza Ali.

00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:32.922
Tap Edit on the Hamza Ali card. The enquiry opens in a form with an Update Enquiry button at the bottom.

00:00:39.407 --> 00:00:50.063
Under Tracking, tap Next Follow-up Date and enter May 5, 2027. Then write in the Notes box what was discussed: Parents will visit the school.

00:01:05.488 --> 00:01:18.400
Tap Update Enquiry. The list opens again, and Hamza Ali's card now has a Follow-up line with the date 2027-05-05. When a date has passed, it turns red.

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:27.217
The follow-up is scheduled, so the call back will not be forgotten.
